# The pages: one button each (HOME: Filter, Engine (named for the engine) and Noise, LFO: LFO and LFO 2, SEL: Mod 1-4, SEQ: Pitch and Pitch 2,
# FX: Distortion, Modulation, Delay, Reverb and Reverb 2,
# pressed again), EDIT and SELECT step through all
wait 200
expect title Filter
expect knob1 Cutoff
expect knob3 Slope
expect knob4 Breath
tap HOME
expect view 1
expect title Classic
expect knob3 Morph
shot engine_page.png
tap HOME
expect view 2
expect knob1 Level
expect knob2 Type
expect val2 BP
expect val3 +24_st
shot noise_page.png
tap HOME
expect view 0
tap ENV
expect view 3
shot breath_page.png
tap LFO
expect view 4
expect knob1 Shape
expect knob2 Rate
expect knob3 Dest
expect knob4 Amount
expect val1 Sine
expect val2 5.0Hz
expect val3 Pitch
expect val4 0c
shot lfo_page.png
tap LFO
expect view 5
expect knob1 Fade
expect knob2 Sync
expect val1 Off
expect val2 Free
wait 50
shot lfo2_page.png
tap SEL
expect view 6
shot mod1_page.png
tap SEL
expect view 7
tap SEL
tap SEL
expect view 9
tap SEL
expect view 6
tap SEQ
expect view 10
expect knob1 Bend
shot pitch_page.png
tap SEQ
expect view 11
expect knob1 CC_depth
wait 50
shot pitch2_page.png
tap GLO
expect view 12
shot setup_page.png
tap EDIT
expect view 13
tap FX
expect view 14
tap FX
expect view 15
tap FX
expect view 16
tap FX
expect view 17
tap FX
expect view 13
tap FX
tap FX
tap FX
tap FX
tap EDIT
expect view 0
turn SELECT 3
expect view 3
turn SELECT -4
expect view 17
tap HOME
expect view 0
# nothing on the screen is stale
wait 50
expect stale 0
